# Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your Mapbox *public* token (starts with "pk.").
# Get one at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
#
# A public token is visible to anyone who opens the website (it is baked into the
# JavaScript bundle), so restrict it in the Mapbox dashboard:
#   * URL restrictions: https://konstantinbiryukov.github.io   (the origin only — browsers send
#                                                              Mapbox the origin, not the path;
#                                                              see IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md §5)
#                       http://localhost:5173   (for local development)
#                       http://localhost:4173   (for `npm run preview`)
#   * Scopes: only the default public scopes (styles:tiles, styles:read, fonts:read, datasets:read).
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=pk.your_public_token_here
